# Prebuilt native helpers (docs/maintenance.md → "Prebuilt helpers"):
#   <group> <key> <arch> <file> <sha256>
# <file> is <arch>.tar.zst (the bucket object <group>/<key>/<arch>.tar.zst)
# or a file inside it. Written by `make helpers-publish` — don't edit by
# hand; `make helpers` refuses anything that doesn't match. A group whose
# current key (hack/helpers-lib.sh) has no entry is built from source.
